# nocturne.trk -- an original 16-bar nocturne in Db for the physical piano.
# 72 BPM, one row per sixteenth, 16 rows per bar.
#   1-8   pedalled broken chords under a singing melody (legato pedal:
#         the pedal lifts for one row at each change of harmony)
#   9-12  staccato, no pedal: the dampers alone shape every note
#   13-14 fortissimo chords over bass octaves, pedal down
#   15-16 a low Db and a high pianissimo chord left ringing
track mel note vel
track lh  note vel
track ch1 note vel cva cvb
track ch2 note vel cva cvb
track ped cva

